#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:4 d4b6a14b62f7486eb7adce246fbe41d4
msgid "Weathervaning and Wind Hold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:6 06353a9857ed469cb2091ea8ec49bb4c
msgid ""
"Flying a Traditional Helicopter, or some Multicopters, in significant "
"levels of wind can present a challenge. The issue is that any flat plate "
"surface, such as a Traditional Helicopter's tail fin and boom, offers a "
"lot of surface area for the wind to interact with. That can lead to a "
"reduction in attitude and position control and high motor and ESC load."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:11 b9c1cec4017b4344ba7f8895276d7740
msgid ""
"To reduce the impact of wind when flying in VTOL modes the ArduPilot code"
" supports active yaw axis weathervaning which can greatly reduce the "
"impact of wind on VTOL flight by keeping the vehicle pointed into the "
"wind and reducing the surface area exposed to the wind."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:16 6911c7ae86c849cf82d3b71bedad77e1
msgid "Active Weathervaning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:18 44e6ae750d9a40af83c4b188ed2b1ad7
msgid ""
"Active weathervaning acts to turn the aircraft into the wind when flying "
"in GUIDED and/or AUTO modes. You can enable active weathervaning by "
"setting the :ref:`WVANE_ENABLE <WVANE_ENABLE>` parameter to a non-zero "
"value and selecting to use it in either GUIDED and/or AUTO modes. The "
"default is not to use active weathervaning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:24 7d946fd51b3449c291b447f1b46f29ed
msgid ":ref:`WVANE_ENABLE<WVANE_ENABLE>` Value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:24 b20d9f10d93a430fac028bbe0b0fd619
msgid "Weathervane Direction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:26 9833da3c12c34cda91b5910691752d13
msgid "0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:26 605b6ca3fbaf42169aa864fb6b39497f
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:28 b891fcdb6e074b838d568b445c7ce35d
msgid "1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:28 e4a4c53ea16548be895e93b30ac558aa
msgid "Nose Into Wind(default)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:30 5056d1f2307b4f0caf963a7076be7835
msgid "2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:30 eedd92b0f4834097b087764f3b449f4d
msgid "Nose OR Tail Into Wind"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:32 78fa378f3bd94e1fb012585fb2e0a071
msgid "3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:32 48574b8246d24fc1a14bcef3fa6a1d90
msgid "Side Into Wind"
msgstr ""

